+                + uid + ": " + ", ".join(reasons),
+                "host_resolution=UNRESOLVED: evidence_hash is the SHA256 of the honest "
+                "decision material, not of a data response",
+                "neither live reviewed UniProt nor the frozen reviewed UID map produced a host "
